# Only what the golden-scan test needs is committed: the frame images, the
# calibration saved with the scan, and the recorded settings / answer.
# Overlays, point clouds, reports, zips and Thumbs.db stay on your PC.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!**/Frames/*.png
!**/scanner-calibration.json
!**/golden-settings.json
!**/golden-expected.json
